1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,182
In this town, a sphinx guards the vault under the castle.

2
00:00:03,451 --> 00:00:08,571
Answer its question, and everything inside is yours. Get it wrong, and you turn to stone.

3
00:00:08,866 --> 00:00:10,611
The square is full of statues.

4
00:00:11,015 --> 00:00:14,458
This year, the King's gold ran out. So he sent his best.

5
00:00:14,645 --> 00:00:15,845
First, the Prince.

6
00:00:16,196 --> 00:00:19,706
"What gets bigger, the more you take away from it?"

7
00:00:20,265 --> 00:00:21,411
"My father's taxes."

8
00:00:21,624 --> 00:00:22,188
Stone.

9
00:00:22,484 --> 00:00:24,197
Then the General. "An army."

10
00:00:24,371 --> 00:00:24,980
Stone.

11
00:00:25,259 --> 00:00:28,696
The King pointed at me. "The stable boy. Nobody will miss him."

12
00:00:29,064 --> 00:00:32,574
"What gets bigger, the more you take away from it?"

13
00:00:33,107 --> 00:00:34,634
I shovel stables every day.

14
00:00:34,862 --> 00:00:35,425
"A hole."

15
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:38,178
The vault opened.

16
00:00:39,403 --> 00:00:42,224
The King came running down the steps. "Those are mine!"

17
00:00:42,502 --> 00:00:44,896
The sphinx turned to him. "Then answer this."

18
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:48,660
"What can you keep, even after you give it away?"

